}

### 1h. Refresh Token (Perpanjang Access Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{loginMahasiswa.response.body.data.refreshToken}}"
}

### 1i. Cek Profil Pengguna Login Saat Ini (/auth/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMahasiswa.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### ==============================================================================
### 2. MODUL MAHASISWA & RISIKO (STUDENTS & RISK)
### ==============================================================================

### 2a. Mahasiswa melihat status & skor risiko pribadi (/students/me/risk)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/me/risk
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMahasiswa.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 2b. Dosen Wali melihat seluruh mahasiswa bimbingan at-risk (/advisees)
GET {{baseUrl}}/advisees
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDoswal.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 2c. Dosen Wali filter advisees khusus status MERAH
GET {{baseUrl}}/advisees?status=MERAH
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDoswal.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 2d. Dosen Wali filter advisees khusus angkatan 2021
GET {{baseUrl}}/advisees?angkatan=2021
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDoswal.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 2e. Detail Risiko Mahasiswa Michael (MERAH - BRL-04 Override: TA >= 2 sem & SSKM < 100)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/24410100007/risk
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDoswal.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 2f. Detail Risiko Mahasiswa Dimitri (KUNING - Bimbingan macet 45 hari & sisa studi <= 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/24410100015/risk
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDoswal.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 2g. Detail Risiko Mahasiswa Novian (KUNING - Presensi < 75% & Alpha > 2x)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/24410100013/risk
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDoswal.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 2h. Detail Risiko Mahasiswa Farrel (KUNING - BRL-09: Sisa studi <= 2 semester)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/24410100016/risk
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 2i. Detail Risiko Mahasiswa Rafi (KUNING - BRL-08: Tunggakan UKT memblokir sidang)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/24410100017/risk
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 2j. [UJI SCOPING BRL-13] Mahasiswa coba akses data mahasiswa lain (HARUS DITOLAK 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/24410100007/risk
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMahasiswa.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 2k. [UJI SCOPING BRL-13] Dosen coba akses mahasiswa yang BUKAN bimbingannya (HARUS DITOLAK 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/24410100016/risk
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDoswal.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### ==============================================================================
### 3. PELACAKAN MILESTONE TA & LOG BIMBINGAN (FR3, BRL-05)
### ==============================================================================

### 3a. Ambil alur milestone TA, status macet > 30 hari, dan syarat min. 8 bimbingan
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/24410100007/milestones
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDoswal.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 3b. Cek milestone mahasiswa yang belum mengambil TA (pilar TA tidak berlaku)
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/26410105001/milestones
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDoswal.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### ==============================================================================
### 4. KONSELING DOSEN WALI (APPEND-ONLY, BRL-16)
### ==============================================================================

### 4a. Dosen Wali mencatat sesi konseling dengan mahasiswa bimbingan
POST {{baseUrl}}/students/24410100007/counseling
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDoswal.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tglKonseling": "2026-11-25",
  "catatan": "Mahasiswa mengalami kendala penulisan Bab 3 dan revisi tertunda. SSKM masih kurang 30 poin.",
  "tindakLanjut": "Dijadwalkan asistensi mingguan intensif tiap Selasa dan diwajibkan mendaftar seminar akademik."
}


### ==============================================================================
### 5. RENCANA TINDAKAN (ACTION PLANS)
### ==============================================================================

### 5a. Ambil daftar action plan perbaikan mahasiswa
GET {{baseUrl}}/action-plans/24410100007
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDoswal.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 5b. Mahasiswa memperbarui status pengerjaan action plan (BELUM -> PROSES -> SELESAI)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/action-plans/1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMahasiswa.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PROSES"
}


### ==============================================================================
### 6. ESKALASI BERJENJANG (ESCALATIONS - BRL-11)
### ==============================================================================

### 6a. Kaprodi melihat antrean eskalasi kasus mahasiswa Red Alert
GET {{baseUrl}}/escalations
Authorization: Bearer {{loginKaprodi.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 6b. Dosen Wali melihat eskalasi mahasiswa binaannya
GET {{baseUrl}}/escalations
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDoswal.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 6c. Kaprodi mencatat tindak lanjut kebijakan khusus atas eskalasi
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/escalations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginKaprodi.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "statusRespons": "DIRESPONS",
  "catatanTindakLanjut": "Kaprodi memberikan dispensasi perpanjangan semester terakhir dan menetapkan tim pendamping TA."
}


### ==============================================================================
### 7. ANALITIK KTW PRODI & EKSPOR LAPORAN (KAPRODI / ADMIN)
### ==============================================================================

### 7a. Kaprodi melihat Executive Health KTW Dashboard & Bottleneck TA
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/ktw
Authorization: Bearer {{loginKaprodi.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 7b. Ekspor Laporan Eksekutif Format PDF
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/export?format=pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{loginKaprodi.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 7c. Ekspor Laporan Eksekutif Format Excel (XLSX)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/export?format=xlsx
Authorization: Bearer {{loginKaprodi.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### ==============================================================================
### 8. PENGATURAN BOBOT & AMBANG BATAS (CONFIG - ADMIN)
### ==============================================================================

### 8a. Admin membaca seluruh parameter konfigurasi aktif
GET {{baseUrl}}/config
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 8b. Admin memperbarui bobot / threshold (tersimpan dinamis tanpa re-deploy)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/config
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parameter": "BOBOT_TA",
  "nilai": 40.0,
  "prodiId": null
}


### ==============================================================================
### 9. MANUAL SCAN & AUDIT LOGS (ADMIN)
### ==============================================================================

### 9a. Admin memicu pemindaian manual seluruh mahasiswa aktif (202 Accepted)
POST {{baseUrl}}/scans
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jenis": "ULANG"
}

### 9b. Admin membaca jejak audit aktivitas sistem (BRL-16 Append-Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-logs?limit=15
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### ==============================================================================
### 10. INTEGRASI EKOSISTEM SMART UNIVERSITY
### ==============================================================================

### 10a. Data Agregat untuk University Dashboard (Menggunakan API Key)
GET {{baseUrl}}/integration/analytics/aggregate
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 10b. Daftar Mahasiswa Berisiko untuk Smart Scheduling (Prioritas Slot Kelas Ulang)
GET {{baseUrl}}/integration/students/at-risk-courses
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 10c. Webhook Masuk dari AI Academic Advisor (Terverifikasi Signature HMAC-SHA256)
POST {{baseUrl}}/integration/webhooks/ai-advisor
Content-Type: application/json
X-EWS-Signature: ae31e2457a2d9e51c376148e100d1778a82ee33ecd1f8885eb5c96833977a740

{
  "riskId": 1,
  "deskripsi": "Saran AI Advisor: Ikuti klinik bimbingan skripsi mingguan dan tuntaskan sisa 30 poin SSKM.",
  "tglTarget": "2026-12-15"
}

### 10d. Webhook Masuk dengan Signature Salah (Harus Ditolak 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/integration/webhooks/ai-advisor
Content-Type: application/json
X-EWS-Signature: invalid_hmac_signature_code_12345

{
  "riskId": 1,
  "deskripsi": "Contoh payload dengan signature salah."
}
